file tools/fixtures/t/two_rooms_doorway_scan.rish read back out; four reach floors, the fourth a folded page, and the ceiling published at 46
file tools/t/two_rooms_doorway.rish read back out; the scan's output printed before any assert
file tools/fixtures/t/two_rooms_doorway_control.sh read back out; fourteen behaviors, ten flipping under the elder roster
file tools/fixtures/t/tame_style_long_fn_one.sh the closing-brace pattern replaced by a brace depth read from code alone, with a named 4096-line bound
file tools/fixtures/t/tame_style_long_fn_control.sh new; twenty behaviors in a pen, three of them biting the elder awk in the same fixture
file tools/fixtures/t/tame_style_long_fn_scan.sh new; the walk and the rank, printing functions_over_70 and longest ahead of the top ten
