file tools/t/tame_style_long_fn_witness.rish new; gates the control, both elder patterns' absence, and a floor of one
file construction/standing-equipment.kyri two guards rostered at tier cadence, each with the cost that chose the clock
file construction/REDS.md %511 booked with the parked lap's measurement at its fetched number, %512 booked with mine
file context/TAME_GUIDANCE.md the claim that the ledger cleared at parity 196 corrected to what the instrument could see
file construction/ITINERARY.md the live front, both accounts folded to their shelf, the ratchet line moved from 14 to 321
recommend keep-going -- the dead-letter box is empty and both instruments say what they can see. The nearest honest lap is the sibling this card already carries: 890 depth-lost links in the two-level fold rooms, the same law hiding a different thing, and the class now has four firings. Two doors are not mechanical: yonder's 262 post-seating pages widen a subject rather than restore one, and dated_path_witness reds at refs_lost=166 against a ceiling of 165 while its scan prints no list, so nobody can name the reference.
